@AersUrl = http://localhost:5161
@RegistrationKey = integration-registration-key

### Job Search Agent
POST {{AersUrl}}/agents/register
X-Registration-Key: {{RegistrationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./job-search.agent-card.json

### CV Analysis Agent
POST {{AersUrl}}/agents/register
X-Registration-Key: {{RegistrationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./cv-analysis.agent-card.json

### Company Research Agent
POST {{AersUrl}}/agents/register
X-Registration-Key: {{RegistrationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./company-research.agent-card.json

### Recommendation Agent
POST {{AersUrl}}/agents/register
